<title>USA: U.S to sell $14 billion of 3-, 6-mo bills June 16.</title>
<headline>U.S to sell $14 billion of 3-, 6-mo bills June 16.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury Department said on Tuesday it will auction $14 billion of three- and six-month bills on June 16 to pay down $4.075 billion as a total of $18.067 billion of bills are maturing.</p>
<p>The weekly bill sale will be equally divided between the two maturities.  The bills will be issued on June 19.  The three-month bills mature on September 18 and the six-month bills mature on December 18.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the three-month bills is 9127942U7 and for the six-month bills is 9127945X8.</p>
</text>
